  "releaseNotes": "Schema-aware element construction. `declare construction preserve` and `declare construction strip` now affect runtime: typed annotations flow through element-constructor copies (preserve) or are reset to Untyped/UntypedAtomic recursively (strip). DeepCopyNode now preserves element-level TypeAnnotation. XQTY0086 raised when content carries a namespace-sensitive (xs:QName, xs:NOTATION, or derived) typed value under `construction preserve`. Closes 5 QT3 schema-aware tests (Constr-cont-constrmod-9/10, Constr-cont-nsmode-7/8/10). Requires PhoenixmlDb.Core >= 1.1.5 for schema-validated source documents to carry attribute TypeAnnotation through the parser.\n      See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
